      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the well of your emotional energy is completely depleted, and hearing platitudes like \"it gets better\" feels dismissive of your deep pain. Please understand that this intense feeling of wanting it all to stop is a serious cry for help, not a weakness. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out to a crisis hotline immediately by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada. They are trained to listen without judgment to exactly what you are feeling right now.",
